{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07286","headline":"送郑十二还庐山别业 · 刘长卿","name":"送郑十二还庐山别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浔阳数亩宅，归卧掩柴关。\n谷口何人待，门前秋草闲。\n忘机卖药罢，无语杖藜还。\n旧笋成寒竹，空斋向暮山。\n水流经舍下，云去到人间。\n桂树花应发，因行寄一攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}